      "title": "How to use these lists",
      "bullets": [
        "Nouns have their <b>article</b> (el / la). Learn them together: el medio ambiente, la ley.",
        "Cover one column and test yourself in both directions. Then write sentences with the B1 grammar: subjunctive, conditional, passive and connectors.",
